[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナちゃん、準備はいい？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ready, Resna?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……はいっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Yes!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "「プロレス」……って、なに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "'Pro Wrestling'... What's that?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あ、そか。えとえと、闘うことでお客さんを魅了する、\nとーってもかっこいい格闘技だよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh, right! Um, it's a really cool combat sport where you captivate the audience through fighting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "武闘大会みたいなもんかな？\n戦って勝つと景品がもらえる、みたいな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like a fighting tournament? You battle and win prizes, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うーん、ベルトはもらえるけど……ちょっと違うかも？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well, you do get a belt, but... it's a bit different."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プロレスの目的は相手をやっつけるだけじゃなくて、\nお互いの全力を引き出して、それでも勝つことだから",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The goal of pro wrestling isn't just to beat your opponent—it's to bring out each other's full power and still come out on top!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "リングで繰り広げられる技と技のぶつかり合い！\n見てるだけで熱くなる最高のエンタメなんだよ～",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Technique clashing against technique in the ring! It's the ultimate entertainment that gets your blood pumping just from watching!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私、プロレスやってみる！\u3000気合の、やーー！！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I want to try pro wrestling! Here I go! Yeah!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "配信をご覧の皆さま！\nただいまからレスナ対ほのかの試合を始めます！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ladies and gentlemen watching the stream! We're about to start the match between Resna and Honoka!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一緒に盛り上がっていきましょーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Let's get hyped together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "――はじめっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Begin!!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Izana"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "行くよっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Here I come!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やーーっ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yaaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずは挨拶がわりのかわいらしいパンチ！\n今の技はどうですか？\u3000解説のヤンネさん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Starting things off with an adorable little punch! How was that move? Let's hear from our commentator, Janne!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ちょっと遠慮しちゃったのかしら？\nレスナちゃんの優しさが出てしまったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Did she hold back a bit? Resna's kindness is showing through."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今度はこっちから行くよ～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now it's my turn!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "てやあああっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hiyaaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きゃあーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kyaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おーっと、レスナ吹き飛ばされたぁ！\n「遠慮はいらないよ」と言わんばかりの一撃！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, and Resna goes flying! That blow said 'no need to hold back!'"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いけー！\u3000ほのかー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Go, Honoka!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "マリー・ローズ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Marie Rose"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "レスナー！\u3000しっかりしなさい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna! Pull yourself together!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヨハナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Johanna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……まだまだこれから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm just getting started!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そりゃあーーーっ！！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Take this!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やーーーーーーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yaaaaaah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はわわわっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whoa whoa whoa!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Honoka"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "大技が決まったぁーっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A big move connects!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今のはイイのが入ったわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was a good hit."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いやあ、ついつい目が吸い寄せられてしまいますなあ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "My eyes are just glued to the action!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "アルビーナ？\u3000真面目にやってる？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you taking this seriously?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……配信の視聴者も大盛り上がりです！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...The stream viewers are getting super excited!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "素敵ー！\u3000レスナちゃーん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Amazing! Go, Resna!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "イザナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "イザナ"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さ、まだまだこれからだよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're just getting started!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ほのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "ほのか"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yeah!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "レスナ"
        }
      }
    }
  }
